  "replies_posted": [
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/UnderdogNBA/status/2046590662573748383",
      "reply_text": "Tough break for the Sixers without Embiid",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-21T16:07:25.841955+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/KeithSmithNBA/status/2046598069349761199",
      "reply_text": "Important dates for the upcoming draft. Players have to make some tough decisions soon.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-21T16:08:11.003255+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/ByMikeWilson/status/2046596091873841598",
      "reply_text": "Not sure what's next for him, but he's got a lot to consider with the deadline approaching.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-21T16:09:04.405660+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/NBAspain/status/2046597323782848583",
      "reply_text": "Early games, man. Need coffee",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-21T16:09:55.074192+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/chibbs_1/status/2046594576832471194",
      "reply_text": "That's awesome! What a great experience to have a great team and meet your wife while playing for the Pacers.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-21T16:10:39.273405+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/PlayoffLucro/status/2046595110259818755",
      "reply_text": "LeBron's still got it. He's been carrying this team all playoffs.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-21T16:11:17.047424+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/FlightWeeed/status/2046593240275542287",
      "reply_text": "That's the kind of resilience that's always defined them.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-21T16:11:51.224441+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/FarroYossi/status/2046569922629656849",
      "reply_text": "That's amazing, but let's not forget his game is still developing.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-21T16:23:13.684496+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/RingoSZN/status/2046599582998466895",
      "reply_text": "Yeah that's the Bucks' resilience I like",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-21T16:23:59.808248+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/SLAM_HS/status/2046595611525329185",
      "reply_text": "That EYBL experience paid off big time",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-21T16:24:55.848241+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/Lakers_World_Fr/status/2046587996833493090",
      "reply_text": "That's a fair point. LeBron's playmaking with Reaves is a big part of their offense",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-21T16:25:42.008322+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/Kingstorian/status/2046595089632575592",
      "reply_text": "Game-winning goals are huge in playoffs. That one mattered.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-21T16:26:31.438284+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/SpinDavies/status/2046592867846566052",
      "reply_text": "Fair to them, Dean's been a steady presence all series",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-21T16:27:04.478092+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/MambaArchives/status/2046581089867633146",
      "reply_text": "Those March stats are insane. He was on fire.",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-21T16:28:00.604165+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/DevaronPerry/status/2046567332114252076",
      "reply_text": "Yeah Mobley's numbers are solid. Barnes' too, but not enough to change the narrative",
      "posted_at": "2026-04-21T16:28:35.453657+01:00"
    },
    {
      "tweet_url": "https://x.com/TheAthleticNBA/status/2046600641724793340",
      "reply_text": "Big change for the Bulls. Wonder what's next for the team.",
